    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR6t0288-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p6.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">This is precisely *huí xīn* (回心, turning the mind),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p6.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">*míng xīn* (明心, clarifying the mind).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p7.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">Vaulting over the wall and entering the mountain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p7.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">is leaving one *yī xīn* (一心, one mind) and entering another *yī xīn* (一心, one mind).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p8.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">What one enters in the mountains</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p8.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">is thinking about the unthinkable.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p9.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">What the world abandons</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p9.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">is non-thinking.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p10.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">To have gathered this into the eyes, two or three *hú* (斛, a unit of dry measure),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p10.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">to have played with this in the *yè shí* (業識, karma consciousness) in myriad ways.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p11.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">In learning the Way like this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p11.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">reward naturally comes from merit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p11.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">Although merit has not yet been achieved from reward,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p11.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">secretly borrowing the nostrils of the Buddhas and Ancestors to exhale,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p11.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">and seizing the hooves of donkeys to give approval,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-05.p11.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">is indeed the model for all time.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p1.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">For a moment, mountains, rivers, the great earth, the sun, the moon, and the stars,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p1.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">all are the mind.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p2.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">At just this very moment,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p2.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">what kind of guarantee manifests itself?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p3.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">To say "mountains, rivers, and the great earth,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p3.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">mountains and rivers are, for example, mountains and water.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p3.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">The great earth is not limited to this place alone.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p4.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">There should also be many mountains;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p4.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">there are great *Xūmí* (須彌, Sumeru) and small *Xūmí* (須彌, Sumeru).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p5.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">Some are situated horizontally,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p5.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">some are situated vertically.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p6.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">There are three thousand worlds,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p6.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">there are countless lands.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p7.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">Some are attached to form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p7.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">some are attached to emptiness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p8.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">There should also be many rivers;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p8.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">there is the celestial river,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_04-06.p8.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:56:50.481+09:00">there is the terrestrial river.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p6.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">To understand.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p7.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">To understand the great path of Dharma-nature by following sutras, scrolls, and teachers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p7.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">is considered to understand Dharma-nature oneself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p8.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">Sutras and scrolls,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p8.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">these are Dharma-nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p8.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">they are oneself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p9.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">Teachers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p9.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">these are Dharma-nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p9.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">they are oneself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p10.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">Dharma-nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p10.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">this is the teacher;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p10.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">Dharma-nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p10.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">this is oneself.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p11.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">Because Dharma-nature is oneself,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p11.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">it is not the self that is wrongly conceived by heretics and demons.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p12.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">In Dharma-nature there are no heretics or demons,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p12.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">only eating congee,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p12.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">eating rice,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-02.p12.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">and drinking tea.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p1.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">However,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p1.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">those who call themselves long-time students of thirty or twenty years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p1.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">when they see and hear discussions of Dharma-nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p1.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">waste their entire lives in a state of bewilderment.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p2.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">Those who call themselves saturated in the monastery groves,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p2.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">and climb upon crooked wooden platforms,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p2.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">upon hearing the voice of Dharma-nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p2.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">upon seeing the color of Dharma-nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p2.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">body and mind, environment and self,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p2.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">constantly ascend and descend into the usual pit of confusion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p3.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">Their state is such that,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p3.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">after the three realms and ten directions that are now seen and heard are completely extinguished,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p3.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">then Dharma-nature will further become manifest;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p3.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">that Dharma-nature</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6t0288_HZ_48-03.p3.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T15:37:32.365+09:00">is wrongly conceived as not being the myriad phenomena and profuse appearances of now.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
